---
import './teste.css';
---

<div>
	<main>
		<section class="hero">
            <div class="hero_container">
                <img src="/hero.jpg" alt="Hero Image" class="hero_img" />

				<div class="hero_content">
                    <h1>Propositum Formarum</h1>
				    <span>Your reference manager, free, open source and offline...</span>
                    
                    <a href="https://github.com/jeovabastos/propositum_formarum/releases/download/v1.0.0/propositum_formarum_1.0.0_amd64.AppImage" target="_blank">DOWNLOAD</a>
                    <a href="https://github.com/jeovabastos/propositum_formarum" target="_blank">SOURCE CODE</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		
        <section>
            <h2>What</h2>
            
            <p>The digital asset manager for your projects!</p>
            <p>Organize your references, then filter by tags and colors. Use the moodboard mode for ideation and place the app as "always on top" as a window with your thoughts. No account required, no internet connection required, open source and free for all time, that's it!</p>
    
            <ul>
                <li>Download the appImage</li>
                <li>Execute the appImage</li>
                <li>Import folders from your computer</li>
                <li>The app will index the folder's images and create thumbnails, showing them with pagination</li>									
                <li><a href="#features_container">See all features!</a></li>							
            </ul>            
        </section>

		<section  id="features_container">
            <h2>Features</h2>
    
            <ul class="features_container">
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Index all images from your folders</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_importar_imagens.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Add notes to your image</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_add_notas.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Select "n" images and add/remove tags</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_add_tags_to_n_images.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Filter images by tag/tags</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_filter_by_tag.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Filter images by colors</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_filter_by_color.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Enter the study mode with filtered images</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_studymode_with_filtered_images.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Write in moodboards with SVGs</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_moodboard_SVGs.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Add images to moodboard</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_moodboard_import_n_images.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Pan movement in moodboard</p>
                        
                        <video controls loop muted playsinline preload="metadata">
                            <source src="/features/feature_moodboard_pan_movement.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>
                <li>
                    <div class="feature">
                        <p>Save and load moodboards</p>
                        
                        <video loop muted playsinline preload="metadata" controls>
                            <source src="/features/feature_moodboard_save_and_load.webm" type="video/webm" />
                            Seu navegador não suporta o formato de vídeo.
                        </video>
                    </div>                    
                </li>                           
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How</h2>

            <p>Tech stack and technical decisions:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Frontend:</strong> React, TypeScript</li>
                <li><strong>Backend & Runtime:</strong> Tauri v2 (Rust)</li>
                <li><strong>Database:</strong> SQLite</li>
                <li><strong>Key Rust Crate Ecosystem:</strong> sqlx, tokio, walkdir, image, kmeans, palette</li>
                <li><strong>AI Assistance:</strong> Used for building color search algorithms and troubleshooting Rust/SQL during development</li>
            </ul>

            <blockquote class="architecture_note">
                <strong>Why Rust + Tauri instead of Electron?</strong><br/>
                Building a high-performance Digital Asset Manager requires fast file indexing, background thumbnail generation, and a responsive UI all running simultaneously. Electron’s higher RAM footprint and single-threaded nature wouldn't provide the level of performance this tool demands, so I chose Rust despite being on my learning journey with it!
            </blockquote>
        </section>        

        <section>
            <h2>What's next?</h2>

            <ul>
                <li>Give multimedia support for the moodboard, like PDFs, videos, 3d objects and so on...</li>
                <li>A mobile version for tablets/smartphones??? I like the idea but I have no enough skill yet...</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <footer>
            <img src="/footer.jpg"/>
        </footer>
	</main>
</div>
